      {
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "text": "澳門威尼斯人 - FOP MACAU VENETIAN-MACAU 06 (PUMA Shop)專案編號：FOP-06-MVAC | 版本：正式核准版 v1.1 | 日期：2026年8月8日",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [
          "24"
        ],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "text": "1 – 工 程 範 圍 (Project Scope)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [
          "26"
        ],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "text": "1.1 項目名稱：澳門威尼斯人 - FOP MACAU VENETIAN-MACAU 06 (PUMA Shop) A&A 改建工程",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "text": "1.2 項目地點：澳門威尼斯人購物中心 (The Venetian Macao) Shop FOP_MACAU_VENETIAN-MACAU_06",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "text": "1.3 工程範圍與邊界：本工程為澳門威尼斯人 PUMA 店舖 (Shop FOP-06) 之內部裝修與機電改建工程（A&A工程）。店舖基準總建築面積為 109.00 m²，包含 PUMA 銷售區與倉庫兩個獨立功能空間。本設計說明涵蓋室內機電空調系統、機械通風排風系統及相關電力控制規範。",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "text": "2 – 設計法規和標準 (Design Regulations & Standards)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [
          "26"
        ],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "text": "2.1 澳門特別行政區法規及標準 (MSAR Regulations)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [
          "23"
        ],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "text": "裝置、材料以及設備應總體符合下列現行的MSAR標準規範、準則以及慣例規範的相關要求：",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "text": "• 澳門土地工務局 (DSSCU)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "text": "• 澳門消防局 (CB)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "text": "• 第15/2021號法律 – 樓宇及場地防火安全的法律制度",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 13,
        "text": "• 第39/2022號行政法規 – 樓宇及場地防火安全技術規章",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "text": "• 澳門電力股份有限公司(CEM)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 15,
        "text": "• 市政署(IAM)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 16,
        "text": "• 環境保護局 (DSPA)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_index": 17,
        "text": "• 澳門自來水股份有限公司(SAAM)",
        "font_sizes_half_points": [],
        "fonts": [
          "Arial Unicode MS"
        ]
      },
      {
